From: Dana Whitfield <dana.whitfield@hangs-gc.example>
To: Tax preparation <tax@finance-demo.example>
Subject: HANGS General Contracting October 2026 close records
Date: Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:40:00 -0800
Message-ID: <HGC-2610-CLOSE@hangs-gc.example>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary="=_HGC_2610_close_records"

--=_HGC_2610_close_records
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hello,

Attached are the October 2026 billing register, purchases register and genera=
l ledger export for HANGS General Contracting LP. The job list, the reseller =
permits on file and the invoice for change order 7 on Pier 9 Lofts are in the=
 shared folder.

Please note the October trial balance has not been approved yet. Treat the le=
dger as unapproved until I confirm.

The only reseller permit we hold for October subcontract work is Cedar Ridge =
Builders. We have asked Summit Line Construction for theirs.

Please prepare the October combined excise return as a draft for review. We f=
ile it ourselves in My DOR once it is reviewed.

Dana Whitfield
Controller, HANGS General Contracting

--=_HGC_2610_close_records
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64
Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="October 2026 billing register.xlsx"
